# ***Tolemi Cohorts***

### ***Demystifying the Data - Powered by YOU!***

Across the country, from executive leaders to on-the-ground public servants, teams sit at the intersection of complex challenges and powerful solutions. Tolemi Cohorts are designed to connect those challenges with practical strategies, peer insight, and real examples from communities doing the work. Our next cohort highlights creative strategies for rural communities on March 23rd. If you’d like to join please [RSVP](https://click.mailchimp.com/track/click/30010842/us06web.zoom.us?) before space runs out.

This is an opportunity to share what’s working, learn from colleagues nationwide, and turn data into action together.

Interested in joining or learning more? Let us know, we’d love to have you.
